    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Digital Wallet, UPI &amp; Double-Entry Ledger</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Learn to move money between accounts so that no rupee is ever created or lost, even when servers crash halfway, clients retry and the accounts sit on different shards. You will also learn to prove it to an auditor afterwards.</p>\n      "
